  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "tāmra.vṛtta.kaṃsa.kāca.danta.bhāṇḍa.ādīnāṃ sthūlaka.dravyāṇām aṣṭa.catvāriṃśat.paṇa.avaraḥ ṣaṇ.ṇavati.paraḥ pūrvaḥ sāhasa.daṇḍaḥ"
